    "summary": "Qualify a dw.tools.math.ir calendar NuGet candidate from six unchanged source files with one exact dependency on published dw.quantities and fifteen independent binary-only IR checks.",
    "value": "Use shared F1 calendar version and published NuGet package reader, compile a disposable source-linked IR project, require the exact nuspec dependency and DLL SHA-256, and exercise canonical JSON, semantic hashes, exact domain rules and matrix-refusal contracts.",
    "debtChanges": [
      "Original dw.tools.math.ir Version 0.3.0-preview.1 and its single Quantities ProjectReference stay untouched; only the temporary packaging projection has an exact PackageReference.",
