      "Three previously published Math archives and all RS134-RS143 receipts remain unchanged; other Math libraries cannot be presumed published from this candidate.",
      "Package notices, rights beyond existing source-owner attestation, installed rollback, other RID compatibility and Discovery/Decision/AURA admission remain open."
    ],
    "nextAction": "After RS144 succeeds, inspect actual IR candidate archive and DLL SHA-256 plus fifteen binary checks, then qualify the shared no-overwrite publisher in a separate disposable-feed rehearsal before any explicitly approved private publication.",
